---
import profileImg from "../assets/profile.png";
import Badge from "../components/Badge.astro";
import p1Img from "../assets/proyectos/p1.png";
import p2Img from "../assets/proyectos/p2.png";
import p3Img from "../assets/proyectos/p3.png";
import p4Img from "../assets/proyectos/p4.png";
---

<div class="page">
  <main>
    <section id="home" class="hero section">
      <div class="container hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-content">
          <p class="eyebrow">Hola!</p>
          <h1>
            Soy <span>Daniela</span><br />
            Full Stack Developer
          </h1>
          <p class="lead">
            Combino diseño y código para crear experiencias web claras y atractivas. Me apasiona construir productos que
            generen impacto real.
          </p>
          <p class="lead">
            Cada desafío es una oportunidad para aprender y aportar una mirada creativa, resolutiva y adaptable a cada
            proyecto.
          </p>
          <a class="text-link" href="#contact">Contame tu idea</a>
        </div>
        <article class="profile-card">
          <Badge />
          <div class="profile-image">
            <img src={profileImg.src} alt="Daniela Manrique avatar" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <h2 class="profile-name">Daniela Manrique</h2>
          <p class="profile-role">Full Stack Developer</p>
          <ul class="profile-details">
            <li>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true">
                <path
                  fill="currentColor"
                  d="M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-7 7c0 5.25 7 13 7 13s7-7.75 7-13a7 7 0 0 0-7-7Zm0 9.5a2.5 2.5 0 1 1 0-5 2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 5Z"
                ></path>
              </svg>
              Neuquén, Argentina
            </li>
            <li>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true">
                <path
                  fill="currentColor"
                  d="M21 4H3a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v14a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h18a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V5a1 1 0 0 0-1-1Zm-1 4.2-8 5-8-5V6l8 5 8-5v2.2Z"
                ></path>
              </svg>
              daniela.manrique1422@gmail.com
            </li>
          </ul>
          <div class="profile-actions">
            <a
              class="button ghost"
              href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/daniela-andrea-manrique-282269138/"
              target="_blank"
            >
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
                <path
                  d="M20.45 20.45h-3.56v-5.4c0-1.29-.02-2.95-1.8-2.95-1.8 0-2.07 1.41-2.07 2.86v5.49H9.46V9.75h3.42v1.46h.05c.48-.9 1.65-1.85 3.4-1.85 3.63 0 4.3 2.39 4.3 5.5v5.59ZM5.34 8.29a2.07 2.07 0 1 1 0-4.14 2.07 2.07 0 0 1 0 4.14ZM7.12 20.45H3.55V9.75h3.57v10.7ZM22.23 0H1.77A1.77 1.77 0 0 0 0 1.77v20.46C0 23.4.6 24 1.77 24h20.46c1.17 0 1.77-.6 1.77-1.77V1.77C24 .6 23.4 0 22.23 0Z"
                ></path>
              </svg>
            </a>
            <a class="button ghost" href="https://github.com/danimanrique" target="_blank">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
                <path
                  d="M12 .5C5.65.5.5 5.74.5 12.2a11.7 11.7 0 0 0 7.66 11.1c.56.1.77-.25.77-.55v-2c-3.12.7-3.78-1.56-3.78-1.56-.5-1.3-1.22-1.65-1.22-1.65-1-.7.08-.68.08-.68 1.1.08 1.68 1.15 1.68 1.15.98 1.71 2.58 1.22 3.22.93.1-.73.38-1.22.68-1.5-2.5-.29-5.12-1.3-5.12-5.8 0-1.28.44-2.31 1.16-3.12-.12-.3-.5-1.53.12-3.18 0 0 .94-.31 3.1 1.19a10.4 10.4 0 0 1 5.64 0c2.14-1.5 3.08-1.19 3.08-1.19.62 1.65.24 2.88.12 3.18.74.81 1.16 1.84 1.16 3.12 0 4.52-2.62 5.5-5.12 5.79.4.36.74 1.04.74 2.1v3.11c0 .3.2.66.78.55a11.7 11.7 0 0 0 7.66-11.1C23.5 5.74 18.35.5 12 .5Z"
                ></path>
              </svg>
            </a>
            <a class="button ghost" href="/CV-Daniela-Manrique.pdf" download>Descargar CV</a>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="about" class="section">
      <div class="container about-grid">
        <div class="section-title">
          <h2>Sobre mí</h2>
          <div class="title-accent"></div>
        </div>
        <article class="about-card">
          <p>
            Tengo más de 8 años de experiencia como desarrolladora Full Stack creando aplicaciones web modernas, escalables y fáciles de mantener.
            Disfruto participar en todo el proceso de desarrollo, desde el diseño y la arquitectura hasta la
            implementación y el despliegue.
          </p>
          <p>
            Me interesa comprender a fondo las necesidades de cada proyecto para diseñar soluciones que aporten valor
            real. Busco resolver problemas complejos con un enfoque práctico y de calidad, y valoro especialmente los
            procesos colaborativos y las metodologías que impulsan la mejora continua.
          </p>
          <a class="text-link" href="#works">Ver proyectos</a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="skills" class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h2>Skills</h2>
          <p>Construyo experiencias completas desde el diseño hasta el deploy en producción.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="services">
          <article class="service">
            <h3>Front End Development</h3>
            <p>HTML · CSS · Angular · React</p>
          </article>
          <article class="service">
            <h3>Back End Development</h3>
            <p>Node.js · Express · NestJS · MySQL</p>
          </article>
        </div>
        <div class="services">
          <article class="service">
            <h3>App Development</h3>
            <p>Ionic · Capacitor · React Native · Expo</p>
          </article>
          <article class="service">
            <h3>DevOps</h3>
            <p>Docker · CI/CD</p>
          </article>
          <article class="service">
            <h3>Automaticación</h3>
            <p>N8N · Make</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="works" class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h2>Proyectos</h2>
          <p>Una selección de trabajos recientes y proyectos en los que he participado.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="works-grid">
          <article class="work-card">
            <div class="work-image">
              <img src={p4Img.src} alt="Project preview" loading="lazy" />
            </div>
            <div class="work-content">
              <h3>Sistema de Monitoreo IoT</h3>
              <p>Permite la administración y monitoreo de dispositivos IoT (específicamente dispositivos Ewon)</p>
              <p><i>Proyecto Privado</i></p>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="work-card">
            <div class="work-image">
              <img src={p2Img.src} alt="Project preview" loading="lazy" />
            </div>
            <div class="work-content">
              <h3>Landing Page</h3>
              <p>Página web personal diseñada para Alicia Susana Arias, escritora de literatura contemporánea.</p>
              <a class="text-link" href="https://alicia-arias.com/" target="_blank">Ver sitio</a>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="work-card">
            <div class="work-image">
              <img src={p1Img.src} alt="Project preview" loading="lazy" />
            </div>
            <div class="work-content">
              <h3>Sistema de Gestión Interno</h3>
              <p>Aplicación web para la gestión de procesos de obras públicas.</p>
              <p><i>Proyecto Privado</i></p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="work-card">
            <div class="work-image">
              <img src={p3Img.src} alt="Project preview" loading="lazy" />
            </div>
            <div class="work-content">
              <h3>Pomodoro Timer</h3>
              <p>
                Temporizador construido con Angular, diseñado para ayudarte a mantener el enfoque y mejorar tu
                productividad.
              </p>
              <a class="text-link" href="https://kaleidoscopic-youtiao-799be5.netlify.app/" target="_blank">Ver sitio</a
              >
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact" class="section">
      <div class="container contact-grid">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h2>Contacto</h2>
          <p>¿Tenés una idea para un sitio o una aplicación web?</p>
          <p>Podemos desarrollarla juntos con un enfoque práctico y orientado a resultados.</p>
        </div>
        <form class="contact-form">
          <div class="field">
            <label for="name">Tu nombre</label>
            <input id="name" type="text" placeholder="Nombre completo" />
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="email">Tu email</label>
            <input id="email" type="email" placeholder="correo@ejemplo.com" />
          </div>
          <div class="field full">
            <label for="message">Tu mensaje</label>
            <textarea id="message" rows="4" placeholder="Escribe tu mensaje aquí"></textarea>
          </div>
          <button class="button primary submit" type="submit">Enviar mensaje</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</div>
<style>
  .page {
    min-height: 100vh;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 20% 20%, rgba(33, 211, 194, 0.08), transparent 55%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 80% 30%, rgba(33, 211, 194, 0.08), transparent 60%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(13, 21, 32, 0.95), rgba(13, 21, 32, 1));
    position: relative;
  }

  .page::before {
    content: "";
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width="400" height="400" viewBox="0 0 400 400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"%3E%3Cpath d="M20 60Q60 20 120 40T240 40T360 20" fill="none" stroke="%2324343f" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.5"/%3E%3Cpath d="M20 140Q80 100 140 120T260 120T360 100" fill="none" stroke="%2324343f" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.4"/%3E%3Cpath d="M20 220Q60 260 140 240T260 240T360 220" fill="none" stroke="%2324343f" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.35"/%3E%3Cpath d="M20 300Q80 340 140 320T260 320T360 300" fill="none" stroke="%2324343f" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.3"/%3E%3C/svg%3E');
    background-size: 500px;
    opacity: 0.35;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .page > * {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .section {
    padding: 64px 0;
  }

  .hero {
    padding-top: 100px;
  }

  .hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr minmax(280px, 320px);
    gap: 48px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .profile-card {
    padding: 32px 28px;
    border-radius: 32px;
    background: rgba(13, 17, 26, 0.9);
    border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.15);
    box-shadow: 0 24px 40px rgba(8, 16, 27, 0.45);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .profile-card::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 8px;
    border-radius: 28px;
    border: 1px solid rgb(19, 45, 47, 0.35);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .profile-image {
    width: 140px;
    align-self: center;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    border-radius: 50%;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 4px solid rgb(19, 45, 47, 0.35);
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgb(19, 45, 47, 0.25), transparent 65%);
  }

  .profile-name {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .profile-role {
    text-align: center;
    color: #94a3b8;
    font-size: 14px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .profile-details {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 8px 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
    color: #cbd5f5;
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .profile-details li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .profile-details svg {
    color: #f4d940;
  }

  .profile-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 12px;
  }

  .button {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 10px 16px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 13px;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .button.primary {
    background: #f4d940;
    color: #05292a;
  }

  .button.primary:hover {
    box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgb(19, 45, 47, 0.3);
  }

  .button.ghost {
    border-color: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.3);
    color: #cbd5f5;
    fill: #cbd5f5;
    background: transparent;
  }

  .button.ghost:hover {
    border-color: rgb(19, 45, 47, 0.5);
    color: #f4d940;
    fill: #f4d940;
  }

  .hero-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    letter-spacing: 0.3em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #f4d940;
    font-size: 12px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 44px);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  h1 span {
    color: #f4d940;
  }

  .lead {
    color: #cbd5f5;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .text-link {
    color: #f4d940;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 14px;
    position: relative;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .text-link::after {
    content: "";
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    border-top: 1.5px solid currentColor;
    border-right: 1.5px solid currentColor;
    transform: rotate(45deg);
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .stats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, auto);
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 20px 28px;
    border-radius: 24px;
    background: rgba(15, 24, 38, 0.92);
    border: 1px solid rgb(19, 45, 47, 0.25);
    width: fit-content;
  }

  .stat {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .stat-value {
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #f4d940;
  }

  .stat-label {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #e2e8f0;
  }

  .stat-caption {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #94a3b8;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }

  .divider {
    width: 1px;
    height: 36px;
    background: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.2);
  }

  .section-title h2,
  .section-header h2 {
    font-size: 28px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .title-accent {
    width: 80px;
    height: 4px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #f4d940, rgb(19, 45, 47, 0));
    border-radius: 999px;
    margin-top: 12px;
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(220px, 260px) 1fr;
    gap: 32px;
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .about-card {
    padding: 28px;
    border-radius: 24px;
    background: rgba(15, 24, 38, 0.85);
    border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.2);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    color: #cbd5f5;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .hello {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #f4d940;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .about-image {
    border-radius: 24px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.2);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(8, 16, 27, 0.4);
  }

  .section-header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .section-header p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #94a3b8;
  }

  .services {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .service {
    padding: 24px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: rgba(15, 24, 38, 0.9);
    border: 1px solid rgb(19, 45, 47, 0.2);
  }

  .service h3 {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    font-size: 18px;
    color: #e2e8f0;
  }

  .service p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #f4d940;
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .skill-tags {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .works-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(360px, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .work-card {
    border-radius: 24px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: rgba(15, 24, 38, 0.85);
    border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.2);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }

  .work-image {
    position: relative;
  }

  .work-image::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, rgba(15, 24, 38, 0.6));
  }

  .work-content {
    padding: 24px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .work-content h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 20px;
    color: #e2e8f0;
  }

  .work-content p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #94a3b8;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .blog-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .blog-card {
    padding: 28px;
    border-radius: 24px;
    background: rgba(15, 24, 38, 0.88);
    border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.2);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .blog-meta {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    color: #f4d940;
    font-size: 12px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }

  .blog-card h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 18px;
    color: #e2e8f0;
  }

  .blog-card p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #a5b4fc;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .blog-actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .chip {
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 8px 18px;
    border: 1px solid rgb(19, 45, 47, 0.4);
    background: rgb(19, 45, 47, 0.12);
    color: #f4d940;
    font-size: 12px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .chip:hover {
    background: rgb(19, 45, 47, 0.2);
  }

  .chip.ghost {
    border-color: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.4);
    background: transparent;
    color: #cbd5f5;
  }

  .contact-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(260px, 320px) 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .contact-form {
    padding: 32px;
    border-radius: 28px;
    background: rgba(15, 24, 38, 0.9);
    border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.2);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .field {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .field label {
    font-size: 12px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: #f4d940;
  }

  .field input,
  .field textarea {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    border-radius: 18px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.25);
    background: rgba(9, 16, 26, 0.85);
    color: #e2e8f0;
    font-size: 14px;
    transition:
      border 0.2s ease,
      box-shadow 0.2s ease;
  }

  .field input:focus,
  .field textarea:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: rgb(19, 45, 47, 0.6);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgb(19, 45, 47, 0.15);
  }

  .field textarea {
    resize: vertical;
    min-height: 120px;
  }

  .field.full {
    grid-column: span 2;
  }

  .submit {
    grid-column: span 2;
    margin-top: 8px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: 24px;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .hero-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      justify-items: center;
    }

    .hero-content {
      text-align: center;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .stats {
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    }

    .contact-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .contact-form {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .field.full,
    .submit {
      grid-column: span 1;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero {
      padding-top: 80px;
    }

    .profile-card {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .stats {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      width: 100%;
    }

    .stats .divider {
      display: none;
    }

    .section {
      padding: 56px 0;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 540px) {
    .section-title h2,
    .section-header h2 {
      font-size: 24px;
    }

    .services {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .skill-tags {
